{"game": "risk-of-rain-2013", "language": "english", "appid": 248820, "month": "2017-11", "window": 2, "start_date": 1510099200, "end_date": 1510790399, "month_true_total": 302, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-07 09:13:52 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "36539068", "author": {"steamid": "76561198027823343", "personaname": "Starfox", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/starfoxz0/", "num_games_owned": 1044, "num_reviews": 37, "playtime_forever": 561, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 561, "last_played": 1475958408, "avatar": "af6a683a6b239c01e7d3c9ce9b67814286e42a81"}, "language": "english", "review": "A hard but fun game. Lots of replay value", "timestamp_created": 1510779119, "timestamp_updated": 1510779119, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "36529907", "author": {"steamid": "76561198008503808", "personaname": "Zombie Jesus", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198008503808/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 3, "playtime_forever": 2361, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2109, "last_played": 1523948747, "avatar": "38f39d2006899508f03f98c5abf71f3d34e8d749"}, "language": "english", "review": "gud", "timestamp_created": 1510747536, "timestamp_updated": 1510747536, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "36527797", "author": {"steamid": "76561198150017946", "personaname": "Renewed Legacy", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/RenewedLegacy/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 1, "playtime_forever": 12610, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 6703, "last_played": 1650212036, "avatar": "8b2c635f87d0c4f507405c64e334b978d2364152"}, "language": "english", "review": "I love this game! If you're into rogue-like games with a ton of items, fun achievements, and a lot of replay ability this is the game for you. With 11 different characters to play and master you can play this game forever without getting bored. There are also a huge amount of items in the game you unlock by completing tasks with each character and unlike many other rogue-like games almost all items in this game can be stacked infinitly for higher effect allowing the player to build a character however they want. Want to be a sniper who moves insanly fast and shoot a ton of missles everytime you shoot? Go for it! Want to just be Mario for a day? Just grab nothing but headstomping boots and jumping items. How about playing super passive and getting items that create a death field around you so you don't have to worry about dying? You can even do that. In fact if you get more then 250 barbed wires then the game just can't spawn things in without immediatly dying inculding bosses. The customization is insane and lead me to happily playing this game for more then 150 hours and collecting all of the achievements. I highly recommend it to everyone who wants to start playing rogue-likes and to those who love them. 10/10", "timestamp_created": 1510737588, "timestamp_updated": 1510737624, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "36524205", "author": {"steamid": "76561198308038641", "personaname": "gianmetal195", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/gianmetal195/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 7, "playtime_forever": 6994, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5602, "last_played": 1778310267, "avatar": "19d683b40d5484d6d1cbd8a58f96f18ff4593036"}, "language": "english", "review": "Beautiful game. Hard, but easy to learn from mistakes, wonderful pixel graphis, Beautiful story, and Hard but not impossible to get achievements.\n\nPerfect Indie Game\n10/10\n\n\nGetting all the achievments as i just said was hard but it was the most fun a had playing an indie game ever.", "timestamp_created": 1510717668, "timestamp_updated": 1510717668, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.523809552192687988", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "36505781", "author": {"steamid": "76561198042588636", "personaname": "Jacory", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/Jacory/", "num_games_owned": 426, "num_reviews": 68, "playtime_forever": 5590, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 5590, "last_played": 1597577881, "avatar": "1f530bb51d564801e3851404fc8997f70dc5594f"}, "language": "english", "review": "hell ya", "timestamp_created": 1510638528, "timestamp_updated": 1651748618, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1383930480", "reactions": []}]}